# Whitelist approach: ignore everything at the root, then re-include only the three
# experiment directories. This repository lives inside a working lab directory that
# also holds unrelated projects, large corpora and virtualenvs.
/*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Experiment_A_Diagnostic/
!Experiment_B_Multilingual/
!Experiment_C_LayerProbe/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- bulk data
# Audio corpora, extracted features and staged copies are reproducible from the
# scripts and are far too large to version (Experiment C's feature cache alone is 87 GB).
**/data/
**/cache/
**/logs/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Per-frame arrays and feature dumps
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.tar
*.pdf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- redundant exports
# CSV mirrors of tables that are also stored as parquet
**/per_file_metrics*.csv
**/per_file_metrics_full.parquet
**/per_file_metrics_crop*.parquet

# Manifests and per-file dumps: these record absolute paths on the machine that ran
# the experiment and are regenerated by the staging scripts.
**/staging_manifest.json
**/fleurs_manifest*.json
**/perfile_*.json
**/masked_perfile_*.json
**/_inventory_*.tsv
**/_inv_*.log
**/_partial_manifest.json

# Corpus metadata downloaded at runtime
**/data/cv_en_*.tsv
**/fairseq_wav2vec_README.md
**/*_paper.txt

# Scratch
*.tmp
*.output

# The discarded pre-fix sweep is not versioned; the corrected run is.
Experiment_C_LayerProbe/results/probe_results_*_PRE_FIX.json
